Sītā affirms husband guru even if faulty --- Sītā praises compassionate self-controlled mother-honoring Rāma --- Sītā recalls forest counsel and fire vow husband service is tapas --- Sītā cites Sāvitrī Anasūyā Rōhiṇī honored in heaven --- Anasūyā offers delight-repayment boon from tapas power --- Anasūyā gives divine garland dress ornaments and unguent --- Sītā accepts gift and Anasūyā asks svayaṃvara tale --- Sītā tells furrow birth sky voice and Janaka joy --- Sītā tells Viśvāmitra arrival bow vow failed kings and Rāma breaking --- Sītā tells water-vessel wedding and Ūrmilā Lakṣmaṇa match